		{
			dependencies: ["3AC46A33165EAB7A"]
			description: [
				"&o&c\"Silent Death\"&r &o是一种在柏树和康乃馨的开阔田野中游荡的顶级掠食者。Skrythe之所以得名，并非因其潜行能力，而是能发出震耳欲聋的声波尖啸，震碎猎物的听觉。它不靠潜行，而是以压倒性的力量无情追逐并撕裂猎物。这种独特的掠食者令所有生物胆寒，历经万古，战胜过传奇巨兽与帝国，至今仍屹立不倒。"
				"百年前，&cThe Arch-Illager's Followers of Dominion&r在前往袭击梅里多尔城墙的途中，不幸遭遇了寂静死亡。&4那一天，田野被鲜血浸染，遍地是钢铁残骸。&r"
				""
				"&4&o所有生物都是斯克里斯的猎物。"
				""
				"&l&4难度：7.5"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "496594924271EB2D"
			progression_mode: "flexible"
			rewards: [{
				count: 8
				id: "5CA92A8578E07464"
				item: "kubejs:arcane_shard"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "破碎的哭泣之浪潮"
			tasks: [{
				entity: "monsterexpansion:skrythe"
				entity_use_tag: false
				entity_vis_idle_mode: "USE_GLOBAL"
				entity_vis_offset_x: 0.0f
				entity_vis_offset_y: 0.0f
				entity_vis_rotation: 0.0f
				entity_vis_silhouette_mode: "NONE"
				entity_vis_size: 1.0f
				entity_vis_spin_mode: "USE_GLOBAL"
				entity_vis_use_as_quest_icon: false
				entity_vis_walk_mode: "USE_GLOBAL"
				id: "0056C68B6638014C"
				type: "kill"
				value: 1L
			}]
			title: "击败斯克里思（Skrythe）"
			x: -2.5d
			y: -3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3AC46A33165EAB7A"]
			description: [
				"&o&5\"当夜之牧羊人看见你时，跪下祈求通行。你将无所作为……因为你无法作为。\"&r"
				""
				"&oThe Voidsent Forest does not take kindly to visitors. Its hospitality comes in the form of the Rhyza, a terrifying monster of darkness that behead you before you can gasp. This Voidspawn abomination kills with an all-consuming fervor like the emptiness that birthed it. Its oundless strength comes from a source unknown accompanied by a perfect, incomparable speed. "
				"虚空森林对普通人和富有的国王来说都是一个谜，因为没有任何理智的探险家敢在哨兵——瑞扎——面前挑战深渊。"
				"母亲们常讲述米达斯的故事，她宁可拒绝整个龙的宝藏，也不愿踏入森林。黄金怎能比得上生命呢？"
				"这对孩子们来说是一堂宝贵的课。但其实，米达斯只是知道，&l&4瑞扎不要独自狩猎&r。"
				""
				""
				"&l&4难度：6.5"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "5E33984617C43886"
			progression_mode: "flexible"
			rewards: [{
				count: 8
				id: "196A1165658CF6C6"
				item: "kubejs:arcane_shard"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "虚空光影 (Voidlit Shadow)"
			tasks: [{
				entity: "monsterexpansion:rhyza"
				entity_use_tag: false
				entity_vis_idle_mode: "USE_GLOBAL"
				entity_vis_offset_x: 0.0f
				entity_vis_offset_y: 0.0f
				entity_vis_rotation: 0.0f
				entity_vis_silhouette_mode: "NONE"
				entity_vis_size: 1.0f
				entity_vis_spin_mode: "USE_GLOBAL"
				entity_vis_use_as_quest_icon: false
				entity_vis_walk_mode: "USE_GLOBAL"
				id: "1E971A3A31FFE73E"
				type: "kill"
				value: 1L
			}]
			title: "击杀一只 Rhyza"
			x: -2.5d
			y: 3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3AC46A33165EAB7A"]
			description: [
				"&o主世界的海洋中潜藏着一股与自然本身几乎同样庞大的力量。传说Leivekilth创造了广袤的冰冻海洋，并摧毁了无数散落在海底的船队。最古老的文献无法追溯此巨兽的起源，而历史则充满了那些试图猎杀此兽以寻求荣耀的传奇船长的名字。 &c愚者。 &4人怎能猎杀风暴？人又怎能摧毁一座山？ &r"
				"务必小心，切勿与 Leivekilth 相遇，否则它会向任何胆敢靠近它的生物释放大自然的怒火。"
				""
				"&l&4难度：9.5/10"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			id: "7DCDE6344D04975F"
			progression_mode: "flexible"
			rewards: [{
				count: 8
				id: "4D2AC12C72D27F72"
				item: "kubejs:arcane_shard"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "雪崩的观察者"
			tasks: [{
				entity: "monsterexpansion:leivekilth"
				entity_use_tag: false
				entity_vis_idle_mode: "USE_GLOBAL"
				entity_vis_offset_x: 0.0f
				entity_vis_offset_y: 0.0f
				entity_vis_rotation: 0.0f
				entity_vis_silhouette_mode: "NONE"
				entity_vis_size: 1.0f
				entity_vis_spin_mode: "USE_GLOBAL"
				entity_vis_use_as_quest_icon: false
				entity_vis_walk_mode: "USE_GLOBAL"
				id: "020940D2C333B6E0"
				type: "kill"
				value: 1L
			}]
			title: "击杀利维基斯（Leivekilth）"
			x: 2.5d
			y: -3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3AC46A33165EAB7A"]
			description: [
				"&oRakoth使大地震动，沙石移位。它以石头为皮，岩石为肉，这片沙漠的化身正是周围寸草不生的原因。在Rakoth沙漠永不停歇的震颤中，植物无法存活，而巨兽的日常活动更碾碎了这片荒凉沙漠中仅存的生命力。"
				"没有剑能刺穿它的皮肤，也没有工具能打破它的外壳。Rakoth的核心由坚不可摧的基岩构成，靠持续吞噬稀有矿物和螺旋菌来维持。"
				"受这头无敌巨兽的传说鼓舞，一位三百年前的传奇战士将 Hellrazor 带到了荒野。他们遭遇了惨痛的失败，就连 Underworld's Alloy 也无法切开沙漠的沙粒。"
				""
				"&o&6\"我主人的剑是所向披靡的。泰罗斯将军的Pyrium灼热如沙漠本身。那是一把足以斩断万物的武器。只可惜他不知道沙漠的沙子到底有多快。\""
				""
				"&l&4难度：8/10"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			id: "501C7A4A55982D4C"
			progression_mode: "flexible"
			rewards: [{
				count: 8
				id: "19826648FAA507EE"
				item: "kubejs:arcane_shard"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "沙丘大屠杀"
			tasks: [{
				entity: "monsterexpansion:rakoth"
				entity_use_tag: false
				entity_vis_idle_mode: "USE_GLOBAL"
